  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "9C27AD88C6C617B9",
      "text": "Willkommen in der Arena von Asarilla!\\c\\nMöchtest du die Erklärung zur Arenaprüfung\\nnoch einmal hören?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "9C27AA88C6C612A0",
      "text": "Deine Aufgabe wird es sein, dich in [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Gymnastik[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\nzu beweisen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "9C27AB88C6C61453",
      "text": "Wenn du die von Tulia selbst erfundene\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Gefühlsgymnastik [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]komplett absolvierst,\\r\\nbestehst du die Prüfung.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "9C27B088C6C61CD2",
      "text": "Um die genauen Regeln zu hören, wende dich\\nauf dem Trainingsgelände an die Dame im\\r\\nschwarzen Trainingsanzug.\\c\\nWenn du die Arena verlässt, findest du das\\nTrainingsgelände links.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "392AC325B77CF72F",
      "text": "Tach, Neuzugang! Hier kannst du dich an der\\nGefühlsgymnastik versuchen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "392AC425B77CF8E2",
      "text": "Du fragst dich jetzt bestimmt, wieso deine\\nLehrerin für Kampfkunst hier in der Arena\\r\\narbeitet, was?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "392AC525B77CFA95",
      "text": "Nun, Arenaleiterin Tulia und ich sind schon seit\\nunserer Kindheit befreundet.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_25",
      "hash64": "3931D325B783310D",
      "text": "Vor einiger Zeit trugen wir einen Pokémon-Kampf\\naus, für den wir eine spezielle Regel ausgemacht\\r\\nhatten...\\c\\nDie Verliererin muss tun, was die Gewinnerin sagt.\\c\\nNun ja... Du kannst dir denken, wie der Kampf\\nausgegangen ist... *seufz*[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 239,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_26",
      "hash64": "3931D025B7832BF4",
      "text": "Aber das hier ist immerhin eine gute Gelegenheit,\\num sich fit zu halten. Also helfe ich aus, wenn ich\\r\\nnicht unterrichte.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "392ABE25B77CEEB0",
      "text": "Die Regeln der Gymnastikprüfung sind simpel!\\nIch führe bestimmte Übungen vor, und du musst\\r\\nsie mir einfach nachmachen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "392ABF25B77CF063",
      "text": "So, bist du bereit für die Arenaprüfung?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "392AC025B77CF216",
      "text": "Sehr schön, dann legen wir mal los!\\nLass deinen Gefühlen freien Lauf![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "392AC125B77CF3C9",
      "text": "Ich versteh schon. Es ist wichtig, sich ordentlich\\nvorzubereiten.\\c\\nKomm wieder, sobald du bereit bist![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "392ACA25B77D0314",
      "text": "Das waren saubere Bewegungen! Du und dein[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]e\\nPokémon habt euch gut geschlagen, Neuzugang![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_27",
      "hash64": "3931D125B7832DA7",
      "text": "Das war großartig! Diese perfekte Ausdruckskraft\\nhat mir ein Lächeln ins Gesicht gezaubert![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "392ACB25B77D04C7",
      "text": "Das war genug des Aufwärmens! Jetzt wollen wir\\ndie Muskeln mit einem Pokémon-Kampf mal so\\r\\nrichtig beanspruchen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_battle_a_01",
      "hash64": "7BAAA2FB34884DBA",
      "text": "Immer schön in Bewegung bleiben! Das ist nicht\\nnur ein Kampf, das ist auch Sport!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "392E4825B7800F05",
      "text": "Sehr gut! Deine[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0101)]mn Pokémon und deinen Muskeln\\ntut es gut, so in Schwung zu kommen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_11",
      "hash64": "392E4725B7800D52",
      "text": "Du wirst doch jetzt nicht schlappmachen, oder?\\nHalt durch, die zweite Hälfte beginnt![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_12",
      "hash64": "392E4625B7800B9F",
      "text": "Der Schweiß tropft und die Emotionen sprudeln\\nhervor! Das war eine spektakuläre Leistung![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_28",
      "hash64": "3931C625B7831AF6",
      "text": "Wirklich perfekt! Ich hatte schon fast vergessen,\\nwer hier wen unterrichtet![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_24",
      "hash64": "3931D225B7832F5A",
      "text": "Versuche, den Muskelkater zu überwinden und\\nim Pokémon-Kampf an deine Grenzen zu gehen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_battle_b_01",
      "hash64": "D4DF63147BD9742D",
      "text": "Ich möchte stärker werden und Muskeln\\naufbauen. Hast du Tipps für mich?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_13",
      "hash64": "392E4525B78009EC",
      "text": "Gut gemacht! Damit bist du am Ende der\\nGefühlsgymnastik angekommen![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_14",
      "hash64": "392E4425B7800839",
      "text": "Du hast zweifelsohne bestanden! Glückwunsch![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_15",
      "hash64": "392E4325B7800686",
      "text": "Die Arenaprüfung gilt aber erst als beendet,\\nwenn du dein Ergebnis beim Empfang vorlegst.\\c\\nJogg also am besten gleich rüber![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_16",
      "hash64": "392E4225B78004D3",
      "text": "Oh, wirklich schade... Ich schätze, dir fehlt die\\nnötige Disziplin, um es mit der Psycho-Arena\\r\\naufzunehmen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_17",
      "hash64": "392E4125B7800320",
      "text": "Wenn du es noch einmal versuchen willst,\\nweißt du ja, wo du mich findest.\\c\\nZeige mir nächstes Mal, wie motiviert du\\nwirklich bist![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_18",
      "hash64": "392E5025B7801C9D",
      "text": "Da bist du ja wieder, Neuzugang!\\c\\nSchön, dass du dich an der Gefühlsgymnastik\\nversuchen willst![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
